  ```javascript
  const sanitizedData = data.replace(/<[^>]*>/g, ''); // Remove HTML tags
  ```
- **Parameterized Queries**: Use parameterized queries for all database interactions to prevent SQL injection.
  ```javascript
  db.run(`INSERT INTO products (name, data) VALUES (?, ?)`, [name, sanitizedData]);
  ```
